  "metadata": {
    "job": "Box-joint panel",
    "revision": "B",
    "notes": "cornerStyle 'tbone' is what makes this joint fit: a round cutter leaves a fillet in every square inside corner, and the mating finger has square ones. Finger depth IS the mating panel's thickness — it is driven by stock, not chosen."
  },
